    {
      "id": "60F94CE4B92DDFE2",
      "title": "&f&lCleric at a glance&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fDecide whether this combat foundation suits you.",
        "",
        "&fHoly-school support, recovery and a sturdy support foundation. Read the three specializations below, then make your personal investment in the skilltree.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fReading this page does not select the class. Compare the root’s bonuses and penalties on the actual skill node.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
      ],
