    {
      "id": "200CE25DAA6F9837",
      "title": "&f&lPriest&r",
      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand the Priest playstyle and its tradeoffs.",
        "",
        "&fMore Holy power and mana regeneration; lower Blood power and melee damage. These are the subclass’s starting tradeoffs and direction, not your character’s final stat totals.",
        "",
        "&6&l◇ HOW TO&r",
        "&61. &fCompare the subclass root with your other two options.",
        "&62. &fInspect its three paths: Divine Channel · Prayer · Grace.",
        "&63. &fChoose and invest in the personal skilltree when you are ready.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fSelect actual healing or support spells and read their targeting rules before helping a teammate.",
        "",
        "&7Reading check · Mark this when you understand the guide.",
        "",
        "&7Optional branch · Supports your journey alongside the main campaign."
