      "description": [
        "&d&l◆ GOAL&r",
        "&fUnderstand this part of your adventure.",
        "",
        "&fThe Priest constellation contains three independent fourteen-node paths: Divine Channel · Prayer · Grace. Optional synergy notables support combinations; the all-path apex checks all three branches.",
        "",
        "&a&l✦ TIP&r",
        "&fFinish each branch through its own prerequisites; a synergy node is not a shortcut to a different apex.",
